{"task": "Prove exactly this local conditional obligation using the supplied NL route. Return only the tactic body through submit_transition. All displayed parameter and input proof binders are already in context.", "packet": {"version": 2, "contract_sha256": "cd8fb9fdd29234ce77d66a9a75529972a23ad1848eff2626643da2cd121aa33d", "header": "import Mathlib
open scoped ContDiff Topology BigOperators
open Set MeasureTheory
noncomputable section
namespace WaveMap
abbrev V (n : ℕ) := Fin n → ℝ
abbrev W (m : ℕ) := EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin m)
def domain (n : ℕ) : Set (V n × ℝ) := {p | 0 < p.2}
def box (n : ℕ) (R : ℝ) : Set (V n) := Set.Icc (fun _ => -R) (fun _ => R)
def innerBox (n : ℕ) (R : ℝ) : Set (V n) := {x | ∀ j, -R < x j ∧ x j < R}
def ut {n m : ℕ} (u : V n × ℝ → W m) (x : V n) (t : ℝ) : W m :=
  deriv (fun s => u (x,s)) t
def utt {n m : ℕ} (u : V n × ℝ → W m) (x : V n) (t : ℝ) : W m :=
  deriv (fun s => ut u x s) t
def ux {n m : ℕ} (u : V n × ℝ → W m) (j : Fin n) (x : V n) (t : ℝ) : W m :=
  fderiv ℝ (fun y => u (y,t)) x (Pi.single j 1)
def uxx {n m : ℕ} (u : V n × ℝ → W m) (j : Fin n) (x : V n) (t : ℝ) : W m :=
  fderiv ℝ (fun y => ux u j y t) x (Pi.single j 1)
def uxt {n m : ℕ} (u : V n × ℝ → W m) (j : Fin n) (x : V n) (t : ℝ) : W m :=
  fderiv ℝ (fun y => ut u y t) x (Pi.single j 1)
def lap {n m : ℕ} (u : V n × ℝ → W m) (x : V n) (t : ℝ) : W m :=
  ∑ j, uxx u j x t
def e {n m : ℕ} (u : V n × ℝ → W m) (x : V n) (t : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ‖ut u x t‖ ^ 2 + ∑ j, ‖ux u j x t‖ ^ 2
def et {n m : ℕ} (u : V n × ℝ → W m) (x : V n) (t : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  deriv (fun s => e u x s) t
def A {n m : ℕ} (u : V n × ℝ → W m) (x : V n) (t : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  inner ℝ (ut u x t) (utt u x t)
def B {n m : ℕ} (u : V n × ℝ → W m) (j : Fin n) (x : V n) (t : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  inner ℝ (ux u j x t) (uxt u j x t)
def T {n m : ℕ} (u : V n × ℝ → W m) (j : Fin n) (x : V n) (t : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  inner ℝ (ut u x t) (uxx u j x t)
def g {n m : ℕ} (u : V n × ℝ → W m) (j : Fin n) (x : V n) (t : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  inner ℝ (ut u x t) (ux u j x t)
def dg {n m : ℕ} (u : V n × ℝ → W m) (j : Fin n) (x : V n) (t : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  fderiv ℝ (fun y => g u j y t) x (Pi.single j 1)
def energy {n m : ℕ} (u : V n × ℝ → W m) (t : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∫ x, e u x t
def fields {n m : ℕ} (u : V n × ℝ → W m) : Set ((V n × ℝ) → ℝ) :=
  {f | f = (fun p => e u p.1 p.2) ∨ f = (fun p => et u p.1 p.2) ∨
    f = (fun p => A u p.1 p.2) ∨
    (∃ j, f = (fun p => B u j p.1 p.2)) ∨
    (∃ j, f = (fun p => T u j p.1 p.2)) ∨
    (∃ j, f = (fun p => g u j p.1 p.2)) ∨
    (∃ j, f = (fun p => dg u j p.1 p.2))}
end WaveMap
open WaveMap
", "parameters": [{"name": "n", "type": "ℕ"}, {"name": "m", "type": "ℕ"}, {"name": "u", "type": "V n × ℝ → W m"}, {"name": "q", "type": "W m"}], "representation": "Space V n is Fin n → ℝ, carrying its finite-product topology and product Lebesgue volume. Its Mathlib sup norm is used only as an auxiliary compatible finite-dimensional norm; source Euclidean coordinate topology, compactness and derivatives are unchanged, and source Euclidean norm expressions on spatial vectors are not replaced by this sup norm. Target W m is EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin m)=PiLp 2 with the Euclidean L² norm and inner product sum of coordinate products. Fin n enumerates source coordinates 1,...,n by j.val+1. u is total on V×ℝ; all assumptions and conclusions concern t>0, and restriction/extension on this open domain leaves derivatives unchanged. ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ means smooth to every finite order; scoped ∞ is (⊤:ℕ∞) coerced to WithTop ℕ∞, whereas the top of WithTop ℕ∞ is analytic order ω. All derivatives are total deriv/fderiv, zero if absent; smoothness at positive times justifies their ordinary meaning. Iterated Fréchet derivative vanishing in N002 is equivalent to all positive-order coordinate partials vanishing by evaluating the multilinear map on the finite spatial/time coordinate basis. fields enumerates exactly e,et,A,Bj,Tj,gj,dgj; membership carries no theorem. energy is a total Bochner integral expression; T003 supplies the guard that it is the finite Lebesgue energy on positive times. No M ports or background-note premise ports are needed. H003 is retained though unused in the source route.", "inputs": [{"id": "H002", "binder": "h_H002", "type": "ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ u (domain n)"}, {"id": "H004", "binder": "h_H004", "type": "∀ x t, 0 < t → ‖u (x,t)‖ = 1"}, {"id": "H005", "binder": "h_H005", "type": "∀ x t, 0 < t → ∃ a : ℝ, utt u x t - lap u x t = a • u (x,t)"}], "target": "∀ x t, 0 < t →
